Output docs/assets/05-lsp-navigation.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"

Type "nvim -u docs/vhs/demo-init.lua docs/vhs/demo/chapters/02_the_crossing.md"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/The Grinding One"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "K"
Sleep 3s
Type "gd"
Sleep 3s
Type "gr"
Sleep 3s
Type ":qa!"
Enter